gs_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2020 Q3","e":"dpz","d":"2020-10-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ritch Allison","x":"And I'm really pleased that that higher ticket was not coming from price increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2020 Q3","e":"dpz","d":"2020-10-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ritch Allison","x":"Price increases around food and delivery charges have been really moderate and in line with inflation, over the course of the third quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2022 Q1","e":"dpz","d":"2022-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"We believe the difference in the top line performance in our company-owned stores as compared to our franchise stores, continues to be driven by more substantial operational challenges combined with more conservative price increases as compared to our franchise stores.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2022 Q1","e":"dpz","d":"2022-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Glass","x":"Speaking of glasses, Russell, you didn't mention, sort of, the consumer reaction to the price increase in March to $6.99.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2022 Q2","e":"dpz","d":"2022-07-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Russell Weiner","x":"We also launched our Mind ordering app, which created a fun ordering experience for – into the new season of stranger things, one of the most popular shows on TV and streaming.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2022 Q2","e":"dpz","d":"2022-07-21","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Jon Tower","x":"And then I guess the question is, you did the Stranger Things promotion in this quarter, and I believe it’s the first time since I won’t say Batman in 2008, but you’ve done anything with really any other brand at least in the TV or streaming businesses.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2022 Q2","e":"dpz","d":"2022-07-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"First, while we continue to explore options to further optimize our consumer pricing architecture in the United States, it is important to highlight that the average price increase we realize in the second quarter across our U.S. system was nearly 6%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2022 Q2","e":"dpz","d":"2022-07-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Carril","x":"Following up on those earlier comments though, can you tell us how you’re thinking about pricing power today?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2022 Q2","e":"dpz","d":"2022-07-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"And you saw that we lowered our guidance for the year on G&A based on that.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2022 Q3","e":"dpz","d":"2022-10-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"During the third quarter, the average price increase that was realized across our U.S. system was 5.4%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2022 Q4","e":"dpz","d":"2023-02-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"During the fourth quarter, the average year-over-year price increase that was realized across our U.S. system was 6.3%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2022 Q4","e":"dpz","d":"2023-02-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"This is really a manifestation of the price increases that we took on the natural offer for Mix of Match in the fourth quarter, in particular for Carryout beginning to flow through.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2023 Q1","e":"dpz","d":"2023-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"During the first quarter, the average year-over-year price increase that was realized across our U.S. system was 6.2%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2023 Q2","e":"dpz","d":"2023-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"During the second quarter, the average price increase across our U.S. system was 3.9%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2023 Q3","e":"dpz","d":"2023-10-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Russell Weiner","x":"And the second is streaming - streamlining operations and quality control with some more predictive tools.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2023 Q3","e":"dpz","d":"2023-10-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"During the third quarter, the average price increase across our U.S. system was 3.2%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2023 Q3","e":"dpz","d":"2023-10-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Russell Weiner","x":"Together, our teams are focused on two important goals: first, transforming customer experiences by enhancing the ordering process through personalization and simplification; and then second, streamlining operations and quality control with more predictive tools.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2023 Q4","e":"dpz","d":"2024-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"In the U.S., we are planning for a modest price increase in the low-single digits.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2024 Q2","e":"dpz","d":"2024-07-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Russell Weiner","x":"Well, with through our research, we knew we figured out when it was time to take price, and we also figured out, when it was time not to take price.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2024 Q2","e":"dpz","d":"2024-07-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Sara Senatore","x":"Obviously, you are still on track for the franchisee profitability targets, but pretty modest price increase that clearly didn't cover inflation for labor insurance.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2024 Q3","e":"dpz","d":"2024-10-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jon Tower","x":"And I was wondering if you could comment on the category and specifically Domino's pricing power over the long term and how you're thinking about that trickling into that 3% annual comp number that you outlined?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2024 Q4","e":"dpz","d":"2025-02-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"A few additional points of color on the P&L. Any metrics we are providing today exclude any impacts from the proposed tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2024 Q4","e":"dpz","d":"2025-02-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"In our US supply chain business, we source most of our food products from within the country, so we are not expecting this to have a meaningful impact if tariffs are put in place.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2025 Q1","e":"dpz","d":"2025-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"So, we're not expecting tariffs to have a material impact on our operating profit.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2025 Q1","e":"dpz","d":"2025-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"And I think from a tariff perspective, if there is any impact, it should not be material enough for it to actually impact demand.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2025 Q1","e":"dpz","d":"2025-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"This increase was partially offset by higher G&A, primarily related to severance expenses, driven by the organizational realignment Russell noted earlier.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2025 Q1","e":"dpz","d":"2025-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"We expect operating profit growth of approximately 8% excluding the impact of currency and approximately $5 million in severance expenses related to our organizational realignment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DPZ 2025 Q2","e":"dpz","d":"2025-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"Excluding this gain and a small amount of severance-related expenses in Q2 related to our previously announced organizational realignment, our income from operations would have increased 13.2%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/21/dominos-dpz-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DPZ 2025 Q3","e":"dpz","d":"2025-10-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"We continue to expect operating income growth of approximately 8%, excluding the impact of foreign currency, severance expenses related to the organization realignment we previously announced in Q1 and the refranchising gain in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/14/dominos-dpz-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DPZ 2025 Q3","e":"dpz","d":"2025-10-14","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Dennis Geiger","x":"The reiterated 2025 guidance for 3%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/14/dominos-dpz-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DPZ 2025 Q4","e":"dpz","d":"2026-02-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sandeep Reddy","x":"And that's why Russell talked about profit power versus pricing power, this is exactly what it is.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/23/dominos-dpz-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DPZ 2025 Q4","e":"dpz","d":"2026-02-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"You know, I've been asked whether or not QSR brands have pricing power anymore given the value consumers are seeking.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/23/dominos-dpz-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[41,1,12627,0,0,0,3357,8569],[42,1,11888,0,0,0,9621,1775],[43,1,11978,0,0,0,9320,2110],[44,1,11924,0,0,0,8996,2134],[45,1,10336,0,0,0,7539,2278],[46,1,10079,0,0,0,8129,1541],[47,1,3081,0,0,0,1922,944],[48,1,2099,0,0,0,1179,668],[49,1,9602,0,0,0,8269,1072],[50,1,9590,0,0,0,7394,1690],[51,1,9236,0,0,0,7133,1558],[52,1,9071,0,0,0,3853,4747],[53,1,9034,0,0,0,7013,1483],[54,1,9578,0,0,0,1705,7074],[55,1,9685,0,0,0,7281,1562],[56,1,9744,0,0,0,6929,1935],[57,1,4752,0,0,0,2840,1393],[58,1,9889,0,0,0,7643,1768],[59,1,9823,0,0,0,6988,2073],[60,1,10173,0,0,0,7622,1792],[61,1,9892,0,0,0,2675,6151],[62,1,9823,0,0,0,7304,1886],[63,1,9205,0,0,0,6914,1472],[64,1,8868,0,0,0,4587,1130],[65,1,9216,0,0,0,7212,1367],[67,1,8815,0,0,0,5786,2185]],"cinema":[[41,1,12627,0,0,0,3357,8569],[42,1,11888,0,0,0,9621,1775],[43,1,11978,0,0,0,9320,2110],[44,1,11924,0,0,0,8996,2134],[45,1,10336,0,0,0,7539,2278],[46,1,10079,0,0,0,8129,1541],[47,1,3081,0,0,0,1922,944],[48,1,2099,0,0,0,1179,668],[49,1,9602,0,0,0,8269,1072],[50,1,9590,0,0,0,7394,1690],[51,1,9236,0,0,0,7133,1558],[52,1,9071,0,0,0,3853,4747],[53,1,9034,0,0,0,7013,1483],[54,1,9578,0,0,0,1705,7074],[55,1,9685,0,0,0,7281,1562],[56,1,9744,0,0,0,6929,1935],[57,1,4752,0,0,0,2840,1393],[58,1,9889,0,0,0,7643,1768],[59,1,9823,0,0,0,6988,2073],[60,1,10173,0,0,0